 r←GetLastMonthSaved(folder year);list
⍝ Returns the last month of `year` saved in a file "usage-data-YYYY-MM.csv" in `folder`, or 0
⍝ when there is none. `year` is a character vector like '2026'.
⍝ Only files of `year` count: the month of a file of an earlier year says nothing about what was
⍝ saved for this one.
 r←0
 :If 0<≢list←##.F.ListFiles folder,'usage-data-',year,'-*.csv'
     list←{⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨list
     r←⌈/{⊃##.A.ToNum ⍵[1 2+≢'usage-data-YYYY-']}¨list
 :EndIf
⍝Done
